  "instructions": [
    "Cook rice noodles according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "Cut pork belly into thin slices and season with salt.",
    "In a pan, cook bacon lardon over medium heat until crispy and set aside.",
    "In the same pan, add shallots and ginger and cook until softened.",
    "Add fish sauce, soy sauce, sugar, and chili flakes to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked pork belly to the pan and cook for 2-3 minutes or until browned.",
    "Add cooked noodles to the pan and stir to combine with the pork and sauce.",
    "Top with crispy bacon lardon, green onions, and a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
